{"id":"faculty-adjunct_faculty:e0010","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"He did his Ph.D. from Indian Institute of Engineering Science and Technology (IIEST), Shibpur. He is presently working as Assistant Professor at National Institute of Technology, Raipur in the Department of Metallurgical Engineering. He is also an entrepreneur educator and engages in advance course in entrepreneurship.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-adjunct_faculty:e0011","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"He did his Ph.D. and MBA from Indian Institute of Technology, Delhi. Dr. Sheshadri has 12+ years of work experience in various global organizations such as IBM Global Business Services, Hewlett Packard Company, Royal Dutch Shell etc. Currently, he is working at Microsoft Corporation as Asia Pacific Regional Solution Manager.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-adjunct_faculty:e0012","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Post qualification experience of about 4 years in finance, audit, taxation and company matters. Currently heading the finance department and independent director of Applylegal.com (Legal Entity Easylegal Solutions Private Limited-Mumbai)","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-adjunct_faculty:e0013","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Post qualification experience of about 7+ years in finance, audit and taxation. Recognized as Fellow Chartered Accountant. Currently, he is partner in a chartered accounting firm based in Raipur.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-adjunct_faculty:e0014","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"He started his professional career as an entrepreneur by manufacturing television and antenna in 1987. In 1992, he joined as Lecturer at the Department of Electrical Engineering, University College of Engineering, Burla Odisha (Established by Govt of Odisha in 1956).","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-adjunct_faculty:e0015","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"He did His Ph.D. from IIT Delhi in the year 1973. He started teaching as a lecturer at IIT-Delhi in the year 1974 and became a Professor in the year 1988.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-adjunct_faculty:e0016","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Dr. Nanjangud C Narendra (NCN) is a Principal Engineer in Ericsson Research Bangalore. Prior to joining Ericsson, he worked in Cognizant Technologies, IBM Research, HP India and Motorola India. He has about 30 years R&D experience in the Indian IT industry.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-adjunct_faculty:e0017","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Dr. Jagadish M completed his Postdoctoral Research work at Chennai Mathematical Institute. He completed his M.Tech and PhD from IIT Bombay. He is currently working as a Data Analyst at Centre for Networked Intelligence, RBCCPS-EECS, IISc Bangalore. Prior to this he was an ML Instructor at Jedi Technologies Pvt. Ltd., Bengaluru.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-adjunct_faculty:e0018","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"He is a software engineer with over 12 years of industry experience building large-scale distributed systems, cloud platforms, developer infrastructure, and AI systems. Throughout his career, he has worked across backend engineering, platform engineering, machine learning infrastructure, data engineering, and more recently, agentic AI engineering, designing systems that power mission-critical applications at scale.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
